...@_theme
direction: right

Spec: AIMService spec {class: user}
Profile: AIMProfile {class: resolved}
Overlay: Service-owned overlay AIMProfile {class: managed}
Cache: AIMProfileCache {class: managed}
ISVC: KServe InferenceService {class: managed}
Route: HTTPRoute {class: managed}

Spec -> Profile: resolve
Profile -> Overlay: overlay?
Profile -> Cache
Profile -> ISVC
ISVC -> Route
